&lt;li class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Advanced commercial acumen — experience managing large-scale budgets with direct accountability for gross profit, revenue forecasting, and financial performance reporting to executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
